cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Phyllodes tumor multi-omics re-analysis: code and summary result tables"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and summary result tables for an integrative transcriptomic and
  DNA methylomic re-analysis of phyllodes tumors, covering differential
  expression, differential methylation, a lncRNA-mRNA co-expression network,
  methylation-expression concordance, and reproducible druggable-target selection.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/OWNER/phyllodes-tumor-multiomics"
url: "https://github.com/OWNER/phyllodes-tumor-multiomics"
keywords:
  - phyllodes tumor
  - breast pathology
  - DNA methylation
  - transcriptomics
  - lncRNA
  - drug repositioning
  - reproducibility
authors:
